    "scope": "Pinned source contracts and independently executed Godot Pause/PSI methods; START/SELECT mapping is the declared 3DS adaptation. Covers normal startup/menu safety, excludes full game and learned PSI target effects.; Normal Lamp victory inputs and physical route to locked basement door. RNG remains original clock-seeded; HP and walking coordinates are recorded with source-route intervals, not equated across runs.; natural Doll room entry, battle and learned level-2 Telepathy; no injected flags, inventory or RNG. Extended ordinary-input route: Doll melody, Carol phone ring, first Dad call, stick selection of Nothing then Record, SaveSelect open/cancel and return; no actual Record write/LOAD claim.; Physical postwin route through Doll melody, hallway/stairs, Carol and Dad; repeated normal call uses Circle Pad choice and opens/cancels SaveSelect. No emulator save write or LOAD; original postwin motion verified separately with official Godot, phone source contracts are pinned rather than a full parallel original playthrough.; Extended normal-input house/Podunk/house/Podunk route without checkpoint or injected items/flags; checks graphics admission and session control, not a complete original playthrough.; Explicit ordinary walk-back before northward run into the locked door: original ram condition is evaluated on body_entered, not continuously while already overlapping. The prior path entered that trigger while walking sideways. Original target warp, combat, phone and field expectations are unchanged.",
